    "icon": "data:image/png;base64,",
    "description": "Joins each row to the record in force at its date (latest on or before, next, or nearest) per key, with a maximum gap and validity end dates.",
    "category": "Preparation",
    "subcategory": "Join",
    "tags": [
        "as-of join",
        "point in time",
        "effective date",
        "exchange rates",
        "price list",
        "slowly changing dimension",
        "temporal join",
        "visokio-agents"
    ],
    "introductoryText": "Attaches to each row of input 1 the row of input 2 that was **in force at that row's date**, per key:\n\n- the latest **exchange rate** on or before each transaction date (weekends and holidays use the last published rate)\n- the **price list** or **tariff** effective at the order date\n- the **owner, grade, address or status** valid at the time (slowly changing dimensions)\n\nOptions:\n- **Direction**: latest on or before (default), next on or after, or nearest\n- **Maximum gap** in days, so a rate that is months old does not count\n- **End date** on input 2 for validity ranges (valid from / valid to)\n- Which input 2 fields to bring across (default: all except keys and dates); names that clash get a suffix\n\nEvery input 1 row is kept, in its original order, with **As Of Date**, **Days From As Of Date** and **As Of Status** (Matched, No record in range, Expired, No date).",
